  "notes": "Government counter-clerk tool. Strong semantic colour system: red = would disqualify, amber = curable by deadline, green = met, each with tinted card background and matching border; disposition panel has a thick red left rule. Deadline countdown in amber in the navy header. Field labels are uppercase tracked grey; problem values (ballot name, residence, district) are bold red. Fix actions are embedded directly under each failing check ('To resolve:' + mini form), and a second tab renders a printable formal deficiency notice. Statutory checks list proposed as new entry 'requirements-checklist'. Viewport scrolls inside the main pane; sidebar stays fixed."
